s":[],"fixedComponents":[]},"translations":{"ariaLabel":"content changes on hover"}},"comp-kesohc6c":{"html":"<h2 class=\"font_2 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:44px; line-height:0.7em; text-align:center;\"> <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:44px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"color:#292929;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">PRIVACY POLICY</span></span></span></span> </h2><h2 class=\"font_2 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:44px; line-height:0.7em; text-align:center;\"> <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:44px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"color:#292929;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">-------------------------------------------------- ----------------</span></span></span></span> </h2>","skin":"WRichTextNewSkin","isQaMode":false,"fullNameCompType":"wysiwyg.viewer.components.WRichText"},"comp-kesoirni":{"html":"<h2 class=\"font_2 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px; line-height:1.5em; text-align:center;\"><span class=\"color_11 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,ｍｓ ｐゴシック,ms pgothic,돋움,dotum,helvetica,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">1. CORPORATE INFORMATION</span></span></span></span></h2>\n\n<h2 class=\"font_2 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px; line-height:1.5em; text-align:center;\">&nbsp;</h2>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:13px; line-height:1.5em; text-align:center;\"><span class=\"color_11 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,ｍｓ ｐゴシック,ms pgothic,돋움,dotum,helvetica,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">In compliance with Law 34/2002, of July 11, on services of the information society and electronic commerce, LOVERS WINE ELEGANCE SL, informs that it is the owner of the web posts: <a data-auto-recognition=\"true\" href=\"http://www.mentcreativa.es\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">www.mentcreativa.es</a>, in accordance with the requirement of article 10 of the aforementioned Law, LOVERS WINE ELEGANCE SL, notifies the following information: the owner of this website is LOVERS WINE ELEGANCE SL with CIF B67052399. registered office: CL BALMES 13 3.1., Postal Code: 08691. Town: MONISTROL DE MONTSERRAT. Province: BARCELONA. The email address to contact the company is: <a data-auto-recognition=\"true\" href=\"mailto:info@mentcreativa.es\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">info@mentcreativa.es</a></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:13px; line-height:1.5em; text-align:center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px; line-height:1.5em; text-align:center;\"><span class=\"color_11 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,ｍｓ ｐゴシック,ms pgothic,돋움,dotum,helvetica,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">2. USER AND LIABILITY REGIME</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px; line-height:1.5em; text-align:center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:13px; line-height:1.5em; text-align:center;\"><span class=\"color_11 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,ｍｓ ｐゴシック,ms pgothic,돋움,dotum,helvetica,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Navigation by access or use of the website <a data-auto-recognition=\"true\" href=\"http://www.mentcreativa.es\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">http://www.mentcreativa.es</a> and all the subdomains and directories included under it, as well as the services or content that can be obtained through it and all domain portals own under the ownership of LOVERS WINE ELEGANCE SL, grants the status of user, by which they accept, when browsing the LOVERS WINE ELEGANCE SL page, all the conditions of use that are established here without prejudice to the application of the corresponding mandatory regulations legal compliance as appropriate. Therefore, if the considerations detailed in this Legal Notice are not in your agreement, please do not use the portal, since any use you make of it or the services and content included in it will imply acceptance of the legal terms contained in this text. The LOVERS WINE ELEGANCE SL website provides a great diversity of information, services and data. The user assumes responsibility for the correct use of the websites. This responsibility will extend to: The veracity and legality of the information provided by the user in the forms issued by LOVERS WINE ELEGANCE SL to access certain content or services offered by the web. The use of the information, services and data offered by LOVERS WINE ELEGANCE SL against the provisions of these conditions, the Law, morality, good customs or public order or that, in another case, may involve injury to the rights of third parties or the operation of the websites. To this end, the User will refrain from using any of the content for illegal purposes or effects, prohibited in this text, harmful to the rights and interests of third parties, or that in any way may damage, disable, overload, deteriorate or prevent the normal use of the contents, other Users or any Internet user (hardware and software). Users will be liable for damages of any kind that the company that owns the website may suffer, directly or indirectly, as a result of breach of any of the obligations arising from the use of the website and this privacy policy. In particular, and merely indicative and not exhaustive, the User undertakes not to transmit, disseminate or make available to third parties information, data, content, messages, graphics, drawings, sound and / or image files, photographs of the web .</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:13px; line-height:1.5em; text-align:center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px; text-align:center;\"><span class=\"color_11 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,ｍｓ ｐゴシック,ms pgothic,돋움,dotum,helvetica,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">3. POLICY OF LINKS AND EXEMPTIONS OF LIABILITY</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"text-align:center; font-size:15px;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:13px; line-height:1.5em; text-align:center;\"><span class=\"color_11 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,ｍｓ ｐゴシック,ms pgothic,돋움,dotum,helvetica,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">LOVERS WINE ELEGANCE SL, is not responsible for the content of the web pages that the user can access through the links established on their websites and declares that in no case will it examine or exercise any type of control over the content of other web pages. Likewise, it does not guarantee the technical availability, accuracy, veracity, validity or legality of pages outside its property that can be accessed through the links.LOVERS WINE ELEGANCE SL, declares that it has adopted all the necessary measures to avoid any damage that may arise from browsing its web pages. Consequently, LOVERS WINE ELEGANCE SL, is not responsible, in any case, for any damages that the user may suffer due to Internet browsing. LOVERS WINE ELEGANCE SL, is not responsible for damages of any kind caused to the User that cause failures or disconnections in the telecommunications networks that produce the suspension, cancellation, installation or interruption of the web service during the provision of the same or prior. Access to the web: <a data-auto-recognition=\"true\" href=\"http://www.mentcreativa.es\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">http://www.mentcreativa.es</a> does not imply an obligation on the part of the company to control the absence of viruses or any other harmful computer element. In any case, the User is responsible for the availability of adequate tools for the detection and disinfection of harmful computer programs. LOVERS WINE ELEGANCE SL, is not responsible for the damages caused to the computer equipment, documents and / or files of the users or third parties during the provision of the service on the Portal.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px; line-height:1.5em; text-align:center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px; line-height:1.5em; text-align:center;\"><span class=\"color_11 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,ｍｓ ｐゴシック,ms pgothic,돋움,dotum,helvetica,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">4. ADVERTISING</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px; line-height:1.5em; text-align:center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:13px; line-height:1.5em; text-align:center;\"><span class=\"color_11 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,ｍｓ ｐゴシック,ms pgothic,돋움,dotum,helvetica,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">The web: <a data-auto-recognition=\"true\" href=\"http://www.mentcreativa.es\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">http://www.mentcreativa.es</a> may host advertising or sponsored content. Advertisers or sponsors are solely responsible for ensuring that the material submitted for inclusion on the website complies with the laws that may be applicable in each case. LOVERS WINE ELEGANCE SL, will not be responsible for any error, inaccuracy or irregularity that the advertising or sponsorship content may contain.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:13px; line-height:1.5em; text-align:center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px; line-height:1.5em; text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"color_11 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,ｍｓ ｐゴシック,ms pgothic,돋움,dotum,helvetica,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">5. MODIFICATIONS</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:13px; line-height:1.5em; text-align:center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:13px; line-height:1.5em; text-align:center;\"><span class=\"color_11 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,ｍｓ ｐゴシック,ms pgothic,돋움,dotum,helvetica,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">LOVERS WINE ELEGANCE SL, reserves the right to make the modifications it deems appropriate, without prior notice, in the content of its websites, both in terms of the contents of the websites and their conditions of use or the conditions general contracting. These modifications may be made, through their websites, in any way admissible by law and will be binding during the time they are published on the website and until they are modified by subsequent ones.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:13px; line-height:1.5em; text-align:center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px; line-height:1.5em; text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"color_11 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,ｍｓ ｐゴシック,ms pgothic,돋움,dotum,helvetica,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">6. RESERVATION OF COOKIES</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:13px; line-height:1.5em; text-align:center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:13px; line-height:1.5em; text-align:center;\"><span class=\"color_11 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,ｍｓ ｐゴシック,ms pgothic,돋움,dotum,helvetica,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">LOVERS WINE ELEGANCE SL (El Placer de la Tierra) reserves the right to use cookies in the user&#39;s navigation through its websites to facilitate personalization and ease of navigation. Following the data protection policy of the company, LOVERS WINE ELEGANCE SL, informs that cookies are associated with the anonymous user and their computer and do not provide by themselves the name or surname of the user. The user has the possibility of configuring his browser in such a way that he is informed of the reception of cookies, being able, if he wishes, to prevent them from being installed on his hard drive. However, to access the websites of LOVERS WINE ELEGANCE SL, the installation of cookies is not mandatory. The user agrees to refrain from reproducing, copying, distributing, making available or in any other way publicly communicating, transforming or modifying the Contents, unless they have the authorization of the holder of the corresponding rights or it is legally permitted.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:13px; line-height:1.5em; text-align:center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px; line-height:1.5em; text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"color_11 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,ｍｓ ｐゴシック,ms pgothic,돋움,dotum,helvetica,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">7. PROTECTION OF PERSONAL DATA</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:13px; line-height:1.5em; text-align:center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:13px; line-height:1.5em; text-align:center;\"><span class=\"color_11 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,ｍｓ ｐゴシック,ms pgothic,돋움,dotum,helvetica,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">In accordance with the provisions of the Organic Law and General Regulation-EU-2016/679 of the Parliament and Council of Europe on the protection of personal data, approved on April 27, 2016, LOVERS WINE ELEGANCE SL, informs users of its website that we are obliged to keep professional secrecy about the personal data collected by the company through the forms on its pages, this obligation will continue even after our commercial or contractual relationship has ended, and in no case can we make public the personal data of visitors and customers on the web without their consent. Minors under 13 years of age cannot give their consent for a business to collect and process their personal data; only their legal representatives (parents or guardians) are the ones who can do it on their behalf. Those businesses that need to process data of children under 13 years of age, must have the means to obtain the consent of their parents or guardians, for example, through an email message addressed to one of them that contains a link to an electronic form. Children under the age of 13 cannot be asked for information about the family environment, the only exception being the identification and contact information of the parents or guardians. These data will be entered in an automated file under the responsibility of the administrator of the website of LOVERS WINE ELEGANCE SL, in order to facilitate, expedite and fulfill the commitments established between both parties. Likewise, LOVERS WINE ELEGANCE SL, informs of the possibility of exercising access rights, which allows the web user to know what personal data the administrator of this page has and in this case they will reply within 30 days, provided that they keep the data, rectification, which allows correcting errors, modifying data that are inaccurate or incomplete and guaranteeing the accuracy of the information, opposition that you may request and ensure that you do not carry out data processing, deletion that allows inappropriate data to be deleted or excessive, limitation, so you can request that the processing of your data be limited when you have exercised your right to rectify your personal data, and portability, so that the user can obtain a copy of the personal data that you have provided in the web in order to be able to transmit to other services, these rights may be exercised by any means that leaves proof of its sending and its receipt in The address: CL BALMES 13 3.1 .. Postal Code: 08691. Town: MONISTROL DE MONTSERRAT Province: BARCELONA. Email: <a data-auto-recognition=\"true\" href=\"mailto:info@mentcreativa.es\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">info@mentcreativa.es</a>, providing a photocopy of the DNI or alternative documentation that proves your identity. As long as you do not tell us otherwise, we will understand that your data has not been modified, that you agree to notify us of any variation and that we have the consent to use it in order to build loyalty in the relationship between the parties. Sending your data through the forms on our website will be subject to the fact that you have read / accepted the Privacy Policy, by means of a mandatory check box at the bottom of the form. In accordance with the provisions of Law 34/2002, on Services of the Information Society and Electronic Commerce in article 21, we request your consent to be able to carry out advertising communications that we consider may be of interest to you, by email or by any other equivalent electronic communication means, this consent will be accepted or denied with a mandatory check box at the bottom of the form.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:13px; line-height:1.5em; text-align:center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px; line-height:1.5em; text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"color_11 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,ｍｓ ｐゴシック,ms pgothic,돋움,dotum,helvetica,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">8. INTELLECTUAL PROPERTY</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:13px; line-height:1.5em; text-align:center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:13px; line-height:1.5em; text-align:center;\"><span class=\"color_11 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,ｍｓ ｐゴシック,ms pgothic,돋움,dotum,helvetica,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">The intellectual and industrial property rights derived from all texts, images, as well as the means and forms of presentation and assembly of its pages belong, by themselves or as an assignee, to LOVERS WINE ELEGANCE SL They will therefore be protected works with intellectual property by the Spanish legal system and both the Spanish and community regulations in this field, as well as the international treaties related to the matter and signed by Spain, may be applied to them. All rights reserved. In compliance with the Intellectual Property Law, the reproduction, distribution, public communication and use of all or part of the contents of its web pages is expressly prohibited without the explicit consent of LOVERS WINE ELEGANCE SL Likewise, LOVERS WINE ELEGANCE SL, is reserves the right to file civil or criminal actions it deems appropriate for the improper use of its web pages and content or for the breach of these conditions.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:13px; line-height:1.5em; text-align:center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px; line-height:1.5em; text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"color_11 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,ｍｓ ｐゴシック,ms pgothic,돋움,dotum,helvetica,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">9. TRUSTED SEALS</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:13px; line-height:1.5em; text-align:center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:13px; line-height:1.5em; text-align:center;\"><span class=\"color_11 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,ｍｓ ｐゴシック,ms pgothic,돋움,dotum,helvetica,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Trust seals are badges that are provided in online stores to demonstrate their quality and safety in online sales. To obtain the seal, they are audited or evaluated to verify that they meet the safety criteria in the purchase and legal compliance in terms of privacy and protection of consumer data. Stores that have a trust seal adhere to a code of conduct and often offer consumers simple, fast and convenient alternative dispute resolution procedures.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:13px; line-height:1.5em; text-align:center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px; line-height:1.5em; text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"color_11 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,ｍｓ ｐゴシック,ms pgothic,돋움,dotum,helvetica,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">10. CERTIFICATES OF COMPLIANCE LSSI-CE AND DATA PROTECTION</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px; line-height:1.5em; text-align:center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:13px; line-height:1.5em; text-align:center;\"><span class=\"color_11 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,ｍｓ ｐゴシック,ms pgothic,돋움,dotum,helvetica,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><a data-auto-recognition=\"true\" href=\"http://www.mentcreativa.es\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">http://www.mentcreativa.es</a> complies with current data protection regulations and with the LSSI-CE, and has been advised on these regulations for GH &amp; S. de JORDI COMAS BIGAS, for which it is awarded two certificates in digital image format so that you can display them on your website.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:13px; line-height:1.5em; text-align:center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px; line-height:1.5em; text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"color_11 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,ｍｓ ｐゴシック,ms pgothic,돋움,dotum,helvetica,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">11. LEGAL ACTIONS, APPLICABLE LEGISLATION AND JURISDICTION</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:13px; line-height:1.5em; text-align:center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:13px; line-height:1.5em; text-align:center;\"><span class=\"color_11 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,ｍｓ ｐゴシック,ms pgothic,돋움,dotum,helvetica,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">The relationship between the user and LOVERS WINE ELEGANCE SL, will be governed by current Spanish regulations and they will be competent to decide on any controversy that may arise between the user and LOVERS WINE ELEGANCE SL, the courts of the town of MANRESA</span></span></span></p>","skin":"WRichTextNewSkin","isQaMode":false,"fullNameCompType":"wysiwyg.viewer.components.WRichText"}}}},"nicknameToCompIdMaps":{}}